te\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/es/fava-beans-nutrition-facts-a-suppliers-insight-into-protein-fiber-and-functional-value/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"th\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/th/fava-beans-nutrition-facts-a-suppliers-insight-into-protein-fiber-and-functional-value/\" />";
